    ['Pearson June 2022 P1 examiner report','Eleven locator-only records across Q3/Q6/Q7/Q8/Q9/Q10/Q11: 6 Section A, 2 Q8, and 3 Section C. Exact prompts and matching local QP/MS checks are recorded in the source index; no candidate wording transcribed. The 28 October 2026 recheck covered all five returned report-text chunks but exposed no visual candidate-script facsimile; candidate-page spans remain unpinned. The targeted image search surfaced unrelated Docsity 2025 material, excluded.','Not duplicated locally; Jina reports 55 pages. Matching P1 QP/MS PDFs are local.','https://qualifications.pearson.com/content/dam/pdf/International%20GCSE/English%20Language%20B/2016/exam-materials/4eb1-01-pef-20220825.pdf'],
    ['Pearson June 2022 P1R examiner report','Eleven locator-only records across Q3/Q6/Q7/Q8/Q9/Q10/Q11: 6 Section A, 2 Q8, and 3 Section C. Exact prompts and matching local QP/MS checks are recorded in the source index; no candidate wording transcribed. The 28 October 2026 recheck covered all four returned report-text chunks but exposed no visual candidate-script facsimile; candidate-page spans remain unpinned. The targeted image search returned only an unrelated Scribd 4EA1/01R 2023 result, excluded.','Not duplicated locally; Jina reports 57 pages. Matching P1R QP/MS PDFs are local.','https://qualifications.pearson.com/content/dam/pdf/International%20GCSE/English%20Language%20B/2016/exam-materials/4eb1-01r-pef-20220825.pdf'],
