    ['Pearson June 2025 P1 examiner report','Twelve locator-only records: two each for Q3/Q6/Q7, two for Q8, one each for Q9/Q10, and two Q11 samples (18/30 on p. 58; 17/30 on p. 62). Exact Q3/Q6/Q7 prompts were rendered and visually checked against local QP pp. 3/7/10; matching AO2/AO3 MS requirements/pages are indexed. Exact Q8–Q11 prompts also checked; OCR is locator evidence only.','Not duplicated locally; Jina reports 63 pages.','https://qualifications.pearson.com/content/dam/pdf/International-GCSE/English-Language-B/2016/Exam-materials/4eb1-01-pef-20250821.pdf'],

    ['Pearson June 2025 P1R examiner report','Eleven locator-only records: two each for Q3/Q6/Q7, two for Q8, and one each for Q9/Q10/Q11. The Q11 AO5 figure has an unresolved text-route conflict (7 vs. 8); the isolated final-chunk fragment is not counted as another sample. Focused official-domain search found no context, and the direct PDF text route stopped before Section C. Exact Q3/Q6/Q7 prompts were rendered and visually checked against local QP pp. 3/7/10; matching AO2/AO3 MS requirements/pages are indexed. Exact Q8–Q11 prompts also checked; scanned candidate wording is not transcribed from OCR.','Not duplicated locally; Jina reports 67 pages.','https://qualifications.pearson.com/content/dam/pdf/International-GCSE/English-Language-B/2016/Exam-materials/4eb1-01r-pef-20250821.pdf'],

    ['Pearson official script-locator inventory (June 2019–June 2025)','Seventy-eight locator-only sample-script records: eleven from June 2019 P1 plus 67 from June 2022/2024/2025 P1/P1R. Across the full set: 42 Section A Q3/Q6/Q7 locators, fourteen Section B Q8 records and 22 Section C Q9–Q11 records. Fourteen June 2023 responses are separately facsimile-transcribed/checked; locators are not transcripts. The June 2025 P1 Q8 pair now carries exact response page ranges (printed pp. 32–35 for 30/30 and pp. 36–39 for 16/30), both image-only pages.','See Official_Pearson_Exemplar_Index.md and Completion_Map.md; separate from the 169/253 answer-set coverage.',''],

