    ['June 2026 report access check','Exact official-domain searches and the public 4EB1 course-materials route did not surface a public June 2026 4EB1/01R report or script facsimile by 2026-10-28. Pearson lists reports from 25 August via ResultsPlus; its 1 October English update says June 2026 exemplars are coming soon. The 12-month centre-access policy is an access context, not proof that no report exists. ResultsPlus was not accessed; no credentials used.','See Answer_Sets/June_2026_P1_Section_A.md and Section_A_Examiner_Research_2024-2025.md. No Paperlords ER is listed.','https://qualifications.pearson.com/en/news-policy/subject-updates/history/getting-ready-for-results-day-summer-2026.html ; https://qualifications.pearson.com/en/news-policy/subject-updates/english/october-2026-teaching-english-update.html ; https://qualifications.pearson.com/en/news-policy/subject-updates/business/june-2026-business-update1.html'],
